              <conditions>
                <condition childId="6c91-d214-036a-50a2" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="notInstanceOf" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="White Scars Chapter Banner" id="95b2-b844-ed11-ab2d" hidden="false">
              <description>This Holy Relic can be revealed in each and every White Scars&apos; Movement Phase during which the bearer has moved and is no longer in a vehicle. Any unit of White Scares infantry or bikes that have at least one model within 6&quot; of the bearer when it is revealed may move an extra D6&quot; rather than firing in the following Shooting phase.
Add +1 to the Space Marine combat resolution socre of any assault that takes place within 6&quot; of the Sacred Banner. However, if the model bearing the standard is slain in close combat, then the enemy model that slew him captures the standard gains the +1 bonus to combat resolution from then on. It is possible for the model to change hands multiple times per game.</description>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="8f0b-3e54-c10f-0a71" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="notInstanceOf" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
